<title>UK: FORECAST-Likely markets reaction to UK election.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Likely markets reaction to UK election.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the tabulated results of a Reuter survey of expectations for UK financial markets after the next general election, widely expected in May 1997.</p>
<p>The survey between September 24 and 26, included 26 economists from London-based banks and investment companies.</p>
<p>It covers the FTSE 100 index, sterling versus the mark, 10-year gilt yields and the basis point spread between gilt and German Bund yields before and after the UK general election.</p>
